on DelayHandler tid
  [  0] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  2] extcall 24 .............................. startTimer()
  [  4] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [  6] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [  8] getparam 0 .............................. <tid>
  [ 10] lt ...................................... <the timer < tid>
  [ 11] jmpifz [ 16] ............................ repeat while the timer < tid
  [ 14] endrepeat [  4]
  [ 16] ret
end
